  "summary": "Building a consistent reading habit takes time and effort, but the benefits are well worth it. By setting a goal, creating a schedule, finding your favorite genre, getting comfortable, and tracking your progress, you can develop a lifelong love of reading and improve your mental and emotional well-being."
